# CHROME LOCKED

Do not modify CHROME unless the same owner message contains the word **UNLOCK**
3 times, names CHROME, and names the miss.

HEADER, FOOTER, and HAMBURGER are locked. 3 UNLOCKS required, and the message must name HEADER, FOOTER, or HAMBURGER plus the miss.

Do not put lock text on user-facing HTML.
